THIRD-PARTY CODE

paper_experiments/experiments/01_rank_ablation_estimator/run/tuned_lens/

    A modified copy of the `tuned-lens` package (Belrose et al., "Eliciting
    Latent Predictions from Transformers with the Tuned Lens", 2023), used to
    evaluate the full-rank tuned-lens baseline under exactly the same loop as
    the original work. The upstream project is distributed under the MIT
    License and remains under its own copyright. Modifications are limited to
    checkpoint loading and evaluation plumbing needed to score our lens
    formats with the unmodified upstream metric code.

paper_experiments/experiments/04_memory_injection/run/datasets/

    multi_hop_1000.csv is derived from the 2WikiMultiHop dataset, redistributed
    under its original license.

    handwritten_obscure_explicit_data.csv is the handwritten obscure/explicit
    probe set introduced by Sakarvadia et al., "Memory Injections: Correcting
    Multi-Hop Reasoning Failures during Inference in Transformer-Based Language
    Models" (2023). It is redistributed unmodified so that the memory-injection
    case study is evaluated on exactly the prompts used in the original work,
    and it remains under its own copyright.
